width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-64\" d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1028\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2084,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"60\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(3111,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJSZ2-222B\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1060,1089)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-3C0\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2F\" x=\"573\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"1074\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"787\" y=\"-1270\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(5552,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-73\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"394\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"673\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"1738\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"7236\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"7625\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"8126\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"8595\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"9207\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"9763\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"10233\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>How can we find the <strong>total area</strong> bounded by the curve? </p>\n<p>One method is to count the number of petals and multiply the area of one petal by the total number of petals. In our case, we have <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">5</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> petals in total, and so the total area bounded by the polar curve is</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"34.032ex\" height=\"6.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1724.2 14652.4 2730.8\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\nA_\\textrm{total}=5A =  \\dfrac{5}{2} \\int_{0}^{\\pi/5} \\sin^2(5\\theta) \\:\\textrm{d}\\theta.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-74\" d=\"M27 422Q80 426 109 478T141 600V615H181V431H316V385H181V241Q182 116 182 100T189 68Q203 29 238 29Q282 29 292 100Q293 108 293 146V181H333V146V134Q333 57 291 17Q264 -10 221 -10Q187 -10 162 2T124 33T105 68T98 100Q97 107 97 248V385H18V422H27Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-6F\" d=\"M28 214Q28 309 93 378T250 448Q340 448 405 380T471 215Q471 120 407 55T250 -10Q153 -10 91 57T28 214ZM250 30Q372 30 372 193V225V250Q372 272 371 288T364 326T348 362T317 390T268 410Q263 411 252 411Q222 411 195 399Q152 377 139 338T126 246V226Q126 130 145 91Q177 30 250 30Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-61\" d=\"M137 305T115 305T78 320T63 359Q63 394 97 421T218 448Q291 448 336 416T396 340Q401 326 401 309T402 194V124Q402 76 407 58T428 40Q443 40 448 56T453 109V145H493V106Q492 66 490 59Q481 29 455 12T400 -6T353 12T329 54V58L327 55Q325 52 322 49T314 40T302 29T287 17T269 6T247 -2T221 -8T190 -11Q130 -11 82 20T34 107Q34 128 41 147T68 188T116 225T194 253T304 268H318V290Q318 324 312 340Q290 411 215 411Q197 411 181 410T1